        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.98rem; color: #78350f; line-height: 1.7;">
          Before buying wholesale sheet cakes, verify two critical clauses in your catering contract:
          <br>
          1. <strong>Commercial Bakery Liability Mandate:</strong> Most venues require outside food to originate from a state-licensed commercial facility. Costco and Sam's Club receipts 100% fulfill this requirement.
          <br>
          2. <strong>Cake Cutting Fee:</strong> If your venue charges <strong>$2.50 to $4.00 per slice</strong> to plate outside cake, a 150-guest wedding incurs $375 to $600 in plating labor! You can often negotiate this fee by requesting a self-serve dessert station rather than individualized table service.
        </p>
